Package: spotPhotosApp
Title: Count Bacteria Colonies from Spots on Agar Plate Photos
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Vincent", "Aranzana-Climent", , "vincent@aracli.org", role = c("cre", "aut"))
Description: The goal is to take pictures of agar plates with bacteria
    spots, count the CFUs, link them with their position on the plate and
    attribute experimental variables to the counts based on said position.
    It uses Fiji-ImageJ for image pre-processing and ilastik for pixel
    classification and object detection.
